<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gold Fields sells property unit stake.</title>
<headline>Gold Fields sells property unit stake.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mining house Gold Fields of South Africa Ltd said on Sunday that it had sold its 43.13 percent stake in Gold Fields Property Co Ltd to Rand Leases Properties Ltd for 48.51 million rand.</p>
<p>The deal was struck for 11 rand a share.</p>
<p>A Gold Fields spokesman said the move was part of the firm's ongoing aim of focusing on its core mining operations.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to continue to exercise caution in their sharedealings until further details are announced.</p>
